 ],
 "note": "r8 removes open.before (and its generation). An r8 host answers such an open with chat error unsupported_version and nothing else: no opened, no page, no reset of the open conversation (the next live message continues at sequence 6), and no new conversation for conv-2 (it gets no live messages). It is never read as an open of the newest page. Older pages use history."
}